# ---- Private source material. Never publish. -------------------------------
# The original art dump. Contains a saved ChatGPT conversation export
# (n:i-us & vc walk cycles.html + its _files bundle) and a desktop screenshot,
# i.e. personal data that has no business in a public repo. It is also 209 MB
# and nothing at runtime reads it.
assets/assets:vietnam/

# Dead pipeline. The V3 cut-out approach is retired (see SPRITE_PIPELINE.md §1);
# 70 MB of source figures kept only for archaeology.
assets/v3_sources/

# ---- Build artifacts. Regenerated by tools/, not sources. -------------------
# Individual rendered frames. The game loads atlas.png/atlas.json only; these are
# ~40 MB of intermediate output from tools/render_model_sprites.py.
assets/sprites3d/*/*_[0-9][0-9].png
assets/sprites3d/*/index.json
assets/sprites3d/*/.outlined.json
assets/props/.toned.json

# Debug captures and contact sheets written during development.
assets/debug/

# ---- Local noise -----------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.vercel
node_modules/
